#: includes/features/custom-code-snippets.php:1163
msgid "A previous request ended in a fatal PHP error while this snippet was executing. The error could not be pinned to an exact line, which usually means it happened inside a hook this snippet registered, inside a file it included, or that the request ran out of memory or time. Fix the snippet and save to re-enable it."
msgstr "此代码片段执行期间，先前的一个请求以严重的 PHP 错误结束。该错误无法定位到确切的行，这通常意味着它发生在此代码片段注册的钩子内、其包含的文件内，或请求耗尽了内存或时间。请修复该代码片段并保存以重新启用它。"

#: includes/features/custom-code-snippets.php:1164
msgid "A previous request ended in a fatal error while this snippet was executing."
msgstr "此代码片段执行期间，先前的一个请求以严重错误结束。"

#: includes/features/custom-code-snippets.php:1166
msgid "A previous request stopped while this snippet was executing and never completed - the process was killed outright (execution timeout, memory limit or a crash). Fix the snippet and save to re-enable it."
msgstr "此代码片段执行期间，先前的一个请求停止且从未完成 - 该进程被直接终止（执行超时、内存限制或崩溃）。请修复该代码片段并保存以重新启用它。"

#: includes/features/custom-code-snippets.php:1167
msgid "A previous request stopped while this snippet was executing and never finished."
msgstr "此代码片段执行期间，先前的一个请求停止且从未结束。"

#: includes/features/custom-code-snippets.php:1174
#, php-format
msgid "(started %1$d time(s) without completing, %2$d second(s) since first run)"
msgstr "（已启动 %1$d 次但未完成，自首次运行以来已过 %2$d 秒）"

#: includes/features/custom-code-snippets.php:1216
#, php-format
msgid "\"%s\" parses cleanly and has been re-enabled."
msgstr "“%s” 解析正常，已重新启用。"

#: includes/features/custom-code-snippets.php:1240
#, php-format
msgid "\"%1$s\" was saved but will NOT run: %2$s (line %3$d). Fix the error and save again to re-enable it."
msgstr "“%1$s” 已保存但不会运行：%2$s（第 %3$d 行）。修复错误后再次保存以重新启用。"

#: includes/features/custom-code-snippets.php:1266
msgid "PHP code or HTML executed within the <code>&lt;head&gt;</code> tags on the frontend. Use for dynamic meta tags, conditional CSS/JS links, etc. You can use <code>&lt;?php ?&gt;</code> tags for PHP code."
msgstr "在前端 <code>&lt;head&gt;</code> 标记内执行的 PHP 代码或 HTML。用于动态元标记、条件 CSS/JS 链接等。您可以将 <code>&lt;?php ?&gt;</code> 标记用于 PHP 代码。"

#: includes/features/custom-code-snippets.php:1272
msgid "PHP code or HTML executed before the <code>&lt;/body&gt;</code> tag on the frontend. Use for late-loading dynamic content, analytics, etc. You can use <code>&lt;?php ?&gt;</code> tags for PHP code."
msgstr "在前端 <code>&lt;/body&gt;</code> 标记前执行的 PHP 代码或 HTML。用于后期加载动态内容、分析等。您可以为 PHP 代码使用 <code>&lt;?php ?&gt;</code> 标记。"

#: includes/features/custom-code-snippets.php:1278
msgid "PHP code or HTML executed within the <code>&lt;head&gt;</code> of WordPress admin pages. Use for conditional admin CSS/JS, admin modifications, etc. You can use <code>&lt;?php ?&gt;</code> tags for PHP code."
msgstr "在 WordPress 管理页面的 <code>&lt;head&gt;</code> 中执行的 PHP 代码或 HTML。用于有条件的管理 CSS/JS、管理修改等。您可以为 PHP 代码使用 <code>&lt;?php ?&gt;</code> 标记。"

#: includes/features/custom-code-snippets.php:1284
msgid "PHP executed immediately when this code feature loads (no hook) – similar to putting code in <code>functions.php</code>. Use for hooks, filters, and functions. Avoid direct output here unless intended. Errors can break your site."
msgstr "当加载该代码功能（无钩子）时，PHP 立即执行 - 类似于将代码放入 <code>functions.php</code> 中。用于钩子、过滤器和函数。除非有意为之，否则避免在此直接输出。错误会导致网站崩溃。"

#: includes/features/custom-code-snippets.php:1290
msgid "Advance Code (functions.php)"
msgstr "高级代码 (functions.php)"

#: includes/features/custom-code-snippets.php:1293
msgid "<strong>EXTREME DANGER:</strong> This code is executed directly. There are no safeguards.  Use this only if you are an expert and understand the risks of breaking your entire site. Revisions are NOT available for this snippet.<br> This code runs directly like it runs in functions.php and with no sanitization regex safe."
