msgid "Enable admin bar toggle functionality on frontend"
msgstr "在前端启用管理栏切换功能"

#: includes/features/other-settings.php:281
msgid "Enabling this adds a toggle button to the admin bar and keyboard shortcut (Ctrl+I) to show/hide the admin bar on the frontend."
msgstr "启用此项会在管理栏中添加一个切换按钮，并添加键盘快捷键（Ctrl+I），用于在前端显示/隐藏管理栏。"

#: includes/features/other-settings.php:282
msgid "The visibility state is saved in your browser and persists across page loads. Useful for taking screenshots or viewing the site without the admin bar."
msgstr "可见性状态保存在您的浏览器中，并在页面加载间保持不变。适用于截图或在没有管理栏的情况下查看网站。"

#: includes/features/other-settings.php:283
msgid "<strong>Important:</strong> Once hidden, you can only show it again using the Ctrl+I keyboard shortcut, so make sure to remember it!"
msgstr "<strong>重要：</strong>一旦隐藏，您只能使用 Ctrl+I 键盘快捷键重新显示它，请务必记住！"

#: includes/features/other-settings.php:306
msgid "Select the user roles for which the admin bar should be disabled on the frontend."
msgstr "选择应在前端禁用管理栏的用户角色。"

#: includes/features/other-settings.php:332
msgid "Select the user roles that should be completely blocked from accessing wp-admin. Blocked users will be redirected to the homepage automatically."
msgstr "选择应完全禁止访问 wp-admin 的用户角色。被阻止的用户将自动被重定向到首页。"

#: includes/features/other-settings.php:333
msgid "<strong>Note:</strong> Administrators are always excluded and cannot be blocked."
msgstr "<strong>注意：</strong>管理员始终被排除在外，无法被阻止。"

#: includes/features/other-settings.php:343
msgid "Enabling this setting will remove several default dashboard widgets from the WordPress admin dashboard."
msgstr "启用此设置后，WordPress 管理仪表板中的多个默认仪表板部件将被移除。"

#: includes/features/other-settings.php:344
msgid "This helps in decluttering the dashboard and focusing on the essential information."
msgstr "这有助于整理仪表盘，并将重点放在基本信息上。"

#: includes/features/other-settings.php:361
msgid "Enter the HTML content for the custom dashboard metabox."
msgstr "输入自定义仪表盘元方框的 HTML 内容。"

#: includes/features/other-settings.php:362
